{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T16:02:57Z","thinking":"**Analyzing File Sizes**\n\nI've just compared the file sizes of the question paper sets. Set A, with full 300 DPI diagrams, weighs in at 481 KB, while Set B, similarly equipped, is slightly smaller at 429 KB. My focus is on the impact of these high-resolution diagrams.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated walkthrough with the image alignment fix and high-resolution embedding details for Word documents.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Half-Yearly Examination 2026–27: Class XII Mathematics\n## Final Walkthrough & Updated Delivery\n\n### Summary of Completed Files\nAll Question Papers and Marking Schemes have been updated with **proper image paragraph formatting (Single Line Spacing + Center Alignment)** to resolve the MS Word picture clipping issue, and **high-contrast 300 DPI embedded diagrams** with solid white backgrounds for maximum visibility.\n\n#### File Locations\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n1. **Set A Question Paper**\n   - Word Document: [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_A_Question_Paper.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.txt)\n\n2. **Set A Marking Scheme & Step-by-Step Solutions**\n   - Word Document: [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n\n3. **Set B Question Paper**\n   - Word Document: [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Question_Paper.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.txt)\n\n4. **Set B Marking Scheme & Step-by-Step Solutions**\n   - Word Document: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n\n---\n\n### Image Visibility & Alignment Fixes\n\n1. **Fixed Word Image Clipping:**\n   - Word paragraphs inheriting fixed line spacing (e.g. 14pt) inadvertently clip inline images to 14pt height.\n   - All image-containing paragraphs now explicitly have `line_spacing_rule = SINGLE`, `line_spacing = None`, and `alignment = CENTER`.\n2. **Solid White Backgrounds:**\n   - All matplotlib diagrams rendered with explicit non-transparent white backgrounds (`#FFFFFF`), thick 2.5–3.0pt colored plot lines, and boxed callout annotations with high contrast.\n3. **Resolution:**\n   - Rendered at **300 DPI** with a standard 3.5–4.0 inch width, fitting within narrow A4 margins.\n","Description":"Walkthrough updated with image alignment fix details.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b78a5d36-6586-4c94-a487-70da0c9f5362\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough artifact"}}]}
